## 4. API (prefix `/api`, JSON, JWT Bearer kecuali dicatat)
| Modul | Endpoint |
|---|---|
| Auth | `POST /auth/login` · `POST /auth/logout` · `GET /auth/me` |
| Users (AD,PM) | `GET/POST /users` · `PATCH /users/:id` · `POST /users/:id/reset-password` |
| Customers | `GET /customers?q=` · `POST` · `GET/PATCH /customers/:id` |
